s2","text":"s GitHub into browsable categories. No website, no runtime — just a readable, clickable, contributab"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" browsable categories. No website, no runtime — just a readable, clickable, contributable directory."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- ✅ Official install: `dsh plugin --profile <name> add <pkg>` (forwards to pnpm; npm / git / tarball"},{"id":"p9s2","text":")\n- ✅ Official discovery: npm + the GitHub `dsh-plugin` topic (**no built-in marketplace**)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## ✨ Why this directory"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Several `awesome-dsh-*` lists already exist. This one is different:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- **14 hand-curated categories** with clear boundaries (taxonomy) — not a flat name dump\n- **Star co"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"unts + install commands** on every entry — judge popularity and install in one glance\n- **Bilingual*"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"* (English primary + 中文) with a one-click toggle\n- **Inline collapsible browsing** — expand every ca"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"tegory right here in the README\n- **Machine-readable data** (web/data.js) + generation scripts + aut"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"ght here in the README\n- **Machine-readable data** (web/data.js) + generation scripts + auto-sync CI"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## ⚡ Quick Start"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Three ways to use this directory:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"1. **Browse** — expand any category below (or jump into a category file); each entry links straight "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"to its GitHub repo.\n2. **Search** — press `t` (or `Ctrl+F`) on the repo page and search keywords lik"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"e `mcp`, `memory`, `TUI`, `multi-agent`.\n3. **Consume programmatically** — read `web/data.js` (gener"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"ated from the category files; see web/README.md)."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 🔥 Hot Plugins"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Top community plugins by GitHub stars:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| # | Plugin | Description | ⭐ |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| 🥇 | deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness | Official core repo: \"everything is a plugin\", driven by Cordis."},{"id":"p19s2","text":" | 276645 |\n| 🥈 | deepseek-harness-desktop | Modern DeepSeek Harness desktop experience | 35417 |\n| "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"🥉 | awesome-dsh-plugin/awesome-dsh-plugin | Community curated list (105 plugins + sites + badges). |"},{"id":"p19s4","text":" 23821 |\n| 4 | dsh-desktop | Cross-platform desktop app | 17610 |\n| 5 | dsh-market | The plugin mark"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"et inside DSH: a Settings page to browse and search the full community catalog by category, with con"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"firmed one-click installs and an installed-plugins view. | 11539 |\n| 6 | dsh-web-ui | DSH Web UI plu"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"gin and skin collection: task board, Git graph, right panel, mobile remote, skin center | 10247 |\n| "},{"id":"p19s8","text":"7 | dsh-TUI | Claude Code-style full-screen terminal UI: pixel-whale header, live status line, and s"},{"id":"p19s9","text":"treaming thought expansion. | 7254 |\n| 8 | deepseek-ai/awesome-deepseek-agent | Official curated lis"},{"id":"p19s10","text":"t of DeepSeek agents. | 6413 |\n| 9 | DSH-better-sidebar | Full sidebar workbench with file rendering"},{"id":"p19s11","text":" and editing, terminal, Git, and subagents; third-party plugins can register new tabs. | 5011 |\n| 10"},{"id":"p19s12","text":" | modlens | Vision bridge for text-only models: paste an image, get structured JSON evidence (OCR, "},{"id":"p19s13","text":"layout, semantics). | 4862 |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## 📊 Stats"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Metric | Value |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| Plugins listed | **353** entries (353 unique) |\n| Categories | **14** top-level |\n| Ecosystem refe"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"rence | `dsh-plugin` topic ~3300+ repos · compat radar 286+ |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 🗂 Categories"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| # | Category | Plugins | Description |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| 1 | 🛠️ Tools | 35 | deterministic tools, git, test runners, safe delete |\n| 2 | 🧩 Skills | 18 | en"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"gineering discipline, skill migration, book-to-skill |\n| 3 | 🔌 MCP | 8 | MCP server management, webf"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"etch, vision MCP |\n| 4 | 🎨 UI / Skins / Themes | 50 | skins, themes, generative UI, input enhancemen"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"ts |\n| 5 | 🖥️ Desktop / TUI / Mobile | 23 | desktop shells, terminal TUI, mobile, companions |\n| 6 |"},{"id":"p25s5","text":" 🤖 Agent Orchestration | 15 | agent teams, plan/execute, A2A, cross-session messaging |\n| 7 | 🧠 Cont"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"ext / Memory | 33 | long-term memory, context compression/audit, session control |\n| 8 | 👁️ Multimod"},{"id":"p25s7","text":"al / Vision | 18 | image Q&A;, OCR, screenshots, computer use |\n| 9 | 🔁 Workflow / Automation | 28 |"},{"id":"p25s8","text":" deep research, cron, condition wakeup, review loops |\n| 10 | 📡 Notifications / Channels | 20 | Tele"},{"id":"p25s9","text":"gram/WeChat/Feishu bots, SSH, desktop notify |\n| 11 | 🌐 Browser / Search | 16 | browser control, scr"},{"id":"p25s10","text":"aping, search providers |\n| 12 | 🏗️ Infra / Plugin Mgmt | 42 | plugin managers, health checks, sandb"},{"id":"p25s11","text":"oxes, telemetry |\n| 13 | 🎮 Fun / Other | 37 | games, pets, stickers, learning, design |\n| 14 | 🏛️ Of"},{"id":"p25s12","text":"ficial & Meta | 10 | core repo, awesome lists, compat radar, community hub |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## 📚 Browse All Plugins"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Expand any category to browse all plugins inline — no need to leave this page."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"🛠️ Tools · 35"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Plugin | ⭐ | Description | Install |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| dsh-toolkit | 33 | Zero-dependency toolkit: time / encoding / json / calculator / csv / regex / ma"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"rkdown / diff / stat / schema — ten deterministic tools in one install. | `dsh plugin add @deepseek-"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ai/dsh-toolkit` |\n| dsh-tool-calculator | 9 | Safe math expression evaluator, zero-dependency recurs"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"ive-descent parser. | `dsh plugin add @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-calculator` |\n| dsh-tool-csv | 4 | Parse"},{"id":"p30s5","text":"/query/aggregate/convert CSV (RFC 4180) with a zero-dependency state-machine parser. | `dsh plugin a"},{"id":"p30s6","text":"dd @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-csv` |\n| dsh-tool-diff | 3 | Structured comparison and unified diffs for te"},{"id":"p30s7","text":"xt/JSON/CSV/Markdown. | `dsh plugin add @deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-diff` |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
